    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d506">

                <pb facs="0531" n="497" sameAs="frus:frus1897/pg497"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Sherman to Mr. Taylor.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department op State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1897-08-21"><hi rendition="#italic">August 21,
                        1897</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Referring your 716 and 726, tobacco, Sartorius filed additional proof June 2,
                    Havana. This alleged sent Madrid June 20. Not arrived date Tetuan’s note June
                    23. Ask favorable decision.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sherman.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
